2. `get(&self, index: usize) -> Option<&T>`: A method that returns a reference to the element at the specified index, if it exists.
3. `set(&mut self, index: usize, value: T) -> Option<&T>`: A method that sets the value at the specified index and returns a reference to the updated element, if it exists.
